---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const alternates = [
  { lang: 'hi-IN', href: '/cookies/' },
  { lang: 'en', href: '/en/cookies/' },
  { lang: 'x-default', href: '/cookies/' }
];
---
<Base title="Cookie Settings | Neelkanth Mahadev Temple Guide" description="View and change the cookie preferences for the independent Neelkanth Mahadev Temple (Shree Neelkanth Mahadev Temple) visitor guide — allow or withdraw analytics and learn about browser storage limits." path="/en/cookies/" locale="en" alternates={alternates}>
<section class="section"><div class="container max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow">Controls</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black">Cookie Settings</h1><p class="mt-3 text-[#596158]"><strong>Last updated: 21 October 2026</strong></p><p class="mt-5 text-[#596158]">We use a limited set of technologies such as cookies and local storage. Essential settings support the site’s basic functionality; Google Analytics activates with your consent. This independent non-profit site currently does not enable personalised advertising cookies.</p><div class="mt-8 space-y-4"><div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><div><h2 class="font-black">Essential cookies</h2><p class="text-sm text-[#596158]">For the site’s basic behaviour and remembering your cookie choice.</p></div><span class="rounded-full bg-[#e7efe9] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-leaf">Always on</span></div><div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><div><h2 class="font-black">Analytics cookies · Google Analytics</h2><p class="text-sm text-[#596158]">Aggregated usage data helps us improve the site.</p></div><label class="flex items-center gap-2"><input id="analytics" type="checkbox" class="h-5 w-5"/><span class="text-sm font-bold">Active</span></label></div><div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><div><h2 class="font-black">Preference cookies</h2><p class="text-sm text-[#596158]">Reserved for future non-essential UI preferences such as theme. Not needed yet.</p></div><span class="rounded-full bg-[#eee9df] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold">Inactive</span></div><div class="card flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5"><div><h2 class="font-black">Marketing / personalised ads</h2><p class="text-sm text-[#596158]">This site does not use personalised advertising cookies.</p></div><span class="rounded-full bg-[#eee9df] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold">Off</span></div></div><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button id="save" class="rounded-full bg-deep px-5 py-3 font-bold text-white">Save preferences</button><button id="reject" class="rounded-full border border-black/15 px-5 py-3 font-bold">Reject Google Analytics</button></div><p id="status" class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-leaf" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="prose mt-10"><h2>Separate hosting measurement</h2><p>The analytics option here is only for Google Analytics. The hosting layer may independently add a Cloudflare Web Analytics script, which measures page-load performance and timing. Rejecting Google Analytics does not turn off this hosting measurement. See Cloudflare’s <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">data collection details</a>, <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/faq/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FAQ</a> and our <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><h2>Consent management</h2><p>You can change Google Analytics consent at any time on this page. The choice is stored in the browser’s local storage. Clearing storage may reset the choice. If browser storage fails, Google Analytics stays off on the current page; a new tab or refresh may re-read the earlier saved preference. Check the status message. Loading embeds such as Google Maps may let the external provider apply its own required technologies; the terms of such embeds are governed by that provider.</p></div></div></section>

</Base>
